# Portable ignore list honored by both BuildKit (ghcr multi-arch build) and
# buildah/podman (the GitLab build-validation job). The BuildKit-only
# "exclude ** then re-include !**/*.go" idiom does not work under buildah:
# it drops all Go sources from the context, so cmd/main.go goes missing.
# Exclude only what the build never needs; the final image is the binary
# alone (distroless COPY manager), so extra context never reaches it.
.git
bin
dist
testbin
.claude

# Tests are not needed to build the manager binary.
**/*_test.go
